# Complete cloud-development environment TEMPLATE — no live credentials included.
# Generated 2026-11-01 from runtime/maintenance source, example files and configured KEY NAMES.
# Do not use this template as production configuration.
# Frontend and backend must use the SAME fresh development JWT_SECRET.
# Supply secrets directly in the cloud secret store, never in chat or committed files.
# Local URLs assume both services and MongoDB run in one cloud environment.
# Replace URLs with actual service URLs when services run in separate environments.

